%[text] %[text:anchor:T_227a] # Capacitors: fundamentals
%[text] [⇦ Main Menu](<matlab:open('MainMenu.m')>)
%[text] In this script, we will explore the fundamental properties and applications of capacitors using electrostatics principles. 
%[text]{"align":"center"} ![](text:image:549d)
%[text:tableOfContents]{"heading":"**Table of Contents**"} %[text:anchor:M_597CA885]
