%[text] %[text:anchor:H_4a9b] ## Conclusion
%[text] In this script, we explored the essential role of capacitors in electrical circuits, focusing on their ability to store and release energy. Based on its physical factors, we've determined an analytical value for the capacitance of a plate capacitor. Through Simscape simulation, we explored the capacitor's charge and discharge and illustrated how it stores energy.
